 que liga o nariz \u00e0 orelha?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A trompa de Eust\u00e1quio se estende do ouvido m\u00e9dio at\u00e9 a parte superior da garganta e se abre durante a degluti\u00e7\u00e3o ou ao bocejar para equilibrar a press\u00e3o.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3801-7c5f-9dc1-4cb608b236aa","description":"Trompa de Eust\u00e1quio","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3801-7a9d-9037-fa05a055dbab","description":"Filtro","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3801-78cd-b2a6-9445b655cc74","description":"Bulbo maxilar","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3801-79b1-952b-50100ac6539c","description":"Nervo \u00f3ptico","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3801-78fb-8260-8f0d2ec2edbc","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que a horologia estuda?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A horologia abrange o projeto, a constru\u00e7\u00e3o e o estudo de rel\u00f3gios de parede e de pulso; um horologista tamb\u00e9m pode restaurar rel\u00f3gios hist\u00f3ricos.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3801-78c0-b9c8-6da47d7d86b8","description":"fabrica\u00e7\u00e3o de rel\u00f3gios, medi\u00e7\u00e3o do tempo e cronometragem","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3801-7553-8320-d0f849d85ce9","description":"animais","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3801-75c0-8f54-95c668c93b73","description":"doen\u00e7as ven\u00e9reas","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3801-752b-8686-2f803f978899","description":"fins ou causas finais","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3801-7c0f-ac59-955143d48a44","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 o menor osso do corpo humano?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"O estribo \u00e9 um dos tr\u00eas ossos min\u00fasculos do ouvido m\u00e9dio, que transmitem as vibra\u00e7\u00f5es sonoras em dire\u00e7\u00e3o ao ouvido interno.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3801-72d4-8030-a19576a17208","description":"Estapedius","correct_answer":true},{"id