-762a-baa6-33bb9fef929f","description":"22","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7fdb-99e3-d9048e0c4d60","description":"66","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7974-ac1c-1176956ecaf6","description":"88","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7fe8-bd04-c5b8c62f96c6","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Na astronomia, qual \u00e9 o termo usado para medir o brilho das estrelas?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A magnitude aparente mede o brilho de uma estrela visto da Terra; ao contr\u00e1rio da magnitude absoluta, ela depende tanto da luminosidade intr\u00ednseca da estrela quanto de sua dist\u00e2ncia.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7574-a5b2-8aa8d259f619","description":"Magnitude aparente","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7d67-86bd-4a256bcfa91f","description":"Luminosidade aparente","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7d3d-8c51-c93ffc858c65","description":"Intensidade aparente","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-729b-9942-f22b3727daba","description":"Radia\u00e7\u00e3o aparente","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7672-a9cb-e5fe220f29ec","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"De onde \u00e9 obtido o medicamento card\u00edaco digit\u00e1lico?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A dedaleira cont\u00e9m glicos\u00eddeos card\u00edacos, como a digoxina, que podem fortalecer as contra\u00e7\u00f5es do cora\u00e7\u00e3o, mas s\u00e3o t\u00f3xicos em doses excessivas.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3802-736e-8dd0-7c4f6c2cf2c5","description":"Dedalheira","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7b0a-8f9e-ff3686ef8cd1","description":"Beladona","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-722f-acee-f52b981fcd9f","description":"Bambu","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7b38-ba49-17a55c35493e","description":"Coco","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-76af-88cb-fcfc49ee3343","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e