3802-70ef-97e3-039744d896ac","description":"Um \u201cclowder\u201d","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-753b-a519-4f38dae20ff1","description":"Uma \u201cmatilha\u201d","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7449-8852-5067e0b1a809","description":"Um \u201cpride\u201d","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7e7a-a410-aa6b2e9cec9c","description":"Um \u201ctroop\u201d","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7c63-8ff8-d5a2c00089a3","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 a palavra para designar um grupo de corvos?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"\u201cAn unkindness\u201d \u00e9 um substantivo coletivo tradicional, ou termo de venery, para corvos; muitos nomes de grupos de animais t\u00eam origens igualmente incomuns.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3802-79c4-ae92-5cadc70d9836","description":"Um \u201cunkindness\u201d","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7b5b-8607-b6080da504fa","description":"Um \u201ccharm\u201d","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7a6a-b202-4722a38b3b47","description":"Um \u201crun\u201d","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7367-8bf3-557e5043a23c","description":"Um cete","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7f5c-b1dc-35ed5426695a","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Em termos m\u00e9dicos, como se chama a condi\u00e7\u00e3o em que um vaso sangu\u00edneo fica obstru\u00eddo por uma bolha de ar que se desloca pela corrente sangu\u00ednea?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Uma embolia ocorre quando um material transportado pela corrente sangu\u00ednea se aloja em um vaso e o obstrui; o ar \u00e9 uma das poss\u00edveis causas, al\u00e9m dos co\u00e1gulos sangu\u00edneos.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7b71-94b2-2cd44560a241","description":"Uma embolia","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-75f4-a359-dcb18a1297b4","description":"Um aneurisma","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7827-a9a