","description":"Um Jack","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-79d8-af29-59e8ad7291b5","description":"Um javali","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7e55-8ce8-8d3d9bc9b74c","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que a codicologia estuda?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A codicologia estuda os livros manuscritos como objetos f\u00edsicos, incluindo seus materiais, constru\u00e7\u00e3o e produ\u00e7\u00e3o; a paleografia se concentra mais na caligrafia.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7020-baaf-3c39910f9c3b","description":"A prepara\u00e7\u00e3o de livros e manuscritos","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-77b1-92b8-e4b2eb5cf0a6","description":"\u00c1gua","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7aff-a64a-7190b896a2c9","description":"A natureza e as origens do conhecimento","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-749c-b59d-a3314265644f","description":"Microrganismos","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7ea3-b1e0-87c127016a1b","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Para que serve o carbonato de c\u00e1lcio, um composto qu\u00edmico frequentemente utilizado?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"O calc\u00e1rio e o m\u00e1rmore s\u00e3o ricos em carbonato de c\u00e1lcio e s\u00e3o utilizados h\u00e1 muito tempo na constru\u00e7\u00e3o civil.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3802-75f2-9135-390d5c8f2272","description":"\u00c9 utilizado como material de constru\u00e7\u00e3o.","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-75e5-bb82-c6f5abdffb67","description":"\u00c9 utilizado para conservar alimentos.","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-74cb-b925-abb4bbe5fe64","description":"\u00c9 usado na fabrica\u00e7\u00e3o de placas de gesso.","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-769c-9447-2a571ed04f11","description":"\u00c9 usado em detergentes para roupas.","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7e2d-83f8-7909df74216c","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual osso N\u00c3O faz parte do cr\u00e2nio humano?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Os ossos do carpo formam o punho; os ossos occipital e temporal fazem parte do cr\u00e2nio, enquanto a maxila forma a mand\u00edbula superior.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3802-76d1-baec-1f4bca5ee9e6","description":"Carpal","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-76b2-bb43-0e84cf7e2e23","description":"Occipital","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7ada-bf40-aaabc87d2f18","description":"Temporal","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7289-b74e-31cd548bae67","description":"Maxila","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-78ae-bd89-9cc1ae1c6d64","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual elemento est\u00e1 faltando na alimenta\u00e7\u00e3o quando ocorre o b\u00f3cio?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"O iodo \u00e9 necess\u00e1rio para a produ\u00e7\u00e3o dos horm\u00f4nios da tireoide; uma defici\u00eancia pode causar o aumento do volume da gl\u00e2ndula tireoide, formando um b\u00f3cio.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7a73-bdb2-039a0a8cdec3","description":"Iodo","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7e99-8681-3d04dd8e673f","description":"Pot\u00e1ssio","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7580-9753-88384bbd9d92","description":"Cloro","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7b92-800e-9dc42a7b4496","description":"Ferro","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7270-b974-c486079a0db5","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual prote\u00edna \u00e9 respons\u00e1vel pelo transporte de oxig\u00eanio no sangue?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A hemoglobina cont\u00e9m grupos heme que cont\u00eam ferro e se ligam ao oxig\u00eanio de forma revers\u00edvel, conferindo aos gl\u00f3bulos vermelhos sua cor.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7bbc-b0c3-68a3d257d63f","description":"Hemoglobina","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7e7b-b751-0c4fcceb8caf","description":"Histona","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7e1d-a9a9-a86d02c0e9dc","description":"Histidina","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-70d1-8716-0d86d6535f88","description":"GABA","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7890-9ec3-a696f4472b48","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 a palavra para designar um grupo de patos-reais?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"\u201cSord\u201d \u00e9 um substantivo coletivo tradicional para patos-reais. Os patos-reais tamb\u00e9m s\u00e3o os ancestrais selvagens da maioria das ra\u00e7as de patos dom\u00e9sticos.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7cc1-9611-34223452bf10","description":"Um \u201csord\u201d","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7fff-ad36-e4aeb86af789","description":"Um \u201cparlamento\u201d","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-73bc-ae37-3e045e9ef318","description":"Um \u201cpaddling\u201d","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-73ef-b5d8-0c6cf8e7e60d","description":"Um \u201cskulk\u201d","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7e2c-83c6-7dbef98cf1d6","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que estuda a ortopterologia?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A ortopterologia trata dos insetos da ordem Orthoptera; o nome tem origem em ra\u00edzes gregas que significam \u201casa reta\u201d, em refer\u00eancia \u00e0s suas asas anteriores.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7151-9223-062ec0bfccf6","description":"gafanhotos e grilos","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7e66-97a2-3b7777ee0e6c","description":"o estudo e o tratamento de doen\u00e7as do trato urogenital","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-70f4-8012-66140645eeee","description":"a biosfera e suas rela\u00e7\u00f5es com a litosfera e a atmosfera","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7992-9f14-b158eca48749","description":"sa\u00f