 para demonstrar que um microrganismo espec\u00edfico causa uma determinada doen\u00e7a.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7bef-96b8-8dd37da1883a","description":"Robert Koch","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7e1c-82c8-f023abe2dcc1","description":"Louis Pasteur","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-77b8-8f50-f8faeaf35894","description":"Joseph Lister","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7e9a-95a9-f4a87d22ddfd","description":"Paul Ehrlich","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7ffb-9ed9-0cb366dc3257","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 o nome coletivo para um grupo de rouxin\u00f3is?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"\u201cA watch\u201d \u00e9 o nome coletivo tradicional para os rouxin\u00f3is, um dos muitos nomes engra\u00e7ados que a l\u00edngua inglesa d\u00e1 a grupos de p\u00e1ssaros.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3802-76f6-85ea-89ddbfd3aa31","description":"A watch","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7f36-b516-5c24174ee927","description":"Um encanto","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7bdc-afaa-30dc16d04faa","description":"Um trapo","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7eeb-9dfc-eb591a0b2168","description":"Uma exalta\u00e7\u00e3o","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7362-ad79-57f9265bf5d2","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 a palavra para designar um grupo de gado?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Um \u201cdrove\u201d \u00e9 um grupo de animais sendo conduzidos juntos; um \u201cgaggle\u201d \u00e9 um bando de gansos, um \u201cpride\u201d \u00e9 uma alcateia de le\u00f5es e um \u201cpod\u201d \u00e9 um grupo de mam\u00edferos marinhos.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7a27-bd1d-13e0dbf9c0e2","description":"Um rebanho","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-73a5-be13-0a4d3ef73cf2","description":"Um cardume","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7973-8db8-0e4cd02fdd75","description":"Um bando","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-71f3-94dc-ba40afc00154","description":"Um pride","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-77cc-839f-2c433e143c54","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Como se chama um jacar\u00e9 macho?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Um \u201cbull\u201d \u00e9 um jacar\u00e9 macho; os machos adultos costumam ser maiores do que as f\u00eameas.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3802-73e7-8025-034fe671f132","description":"Um \u201cbull\u201d","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7fcb-b46e-aeec9ebf8679","description":"Um \u201ccock\u201d","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-793b-b1d9-03f531873dff","description":"Um \u201ctom\u201d","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7276-985c-feed4dfed30c","description":"Um \u201cbuck\u201d","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-75e7-a4b8-9e1c9d24da5c","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 a temperatura corporal m\u00e9dia dos seres humanos?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"37 \u00b0C (98,6 \u00b0F) \u00e9 o valor de refer\u00eancia tradicional, embora as leituras consideradas saud\u00e1veis variem de acordo com a pessoa, a hora do dia e o m\u00e9todo de medi\u00e7\u00e3o.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3802-76d9-aa74-9f95b591fa07","description":"37 \u00b0C","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-777a-912c-a300f510c5a8","description":"35 \u00b0C","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-73c4-8e39-888f97890dca","description":"33 \u00b0C","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7f8c-a252-80ba3087b1db","description":"39 \u00b0C","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7c06-90ca-06dd7db7f068","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 outro termo para carboidrato?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Os sacar\u00eddeos s\u00e3o a\u00e7\u00facares e carboidratos relacionados; a glicose e a fru