id":"01a218f9-3802-7d5c-a91e-5e217feeb535","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que a tricologia estuda?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A tricologia se concentra na sa\u00fade do cabelo e do couro cabeludo, incluindo quest\u00f5es como queda de cabelo e caspa.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3802-74e9-be83-8628fa484ac6","description":"cabelo e couro cabeludo","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7293-8275-da08b70a7a4e","description":"anjos","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7e50-8248-911f7e2b2002","description":"a ecologia das comunidades vegetais","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7e88-b163-c18ba2a7fcc8","description":"sono","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7f79-8467-c2424d8b9451","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual f\u00edsico franc\u00eas descobriu a radioatividade enquanto estudava sais de ur\u00e2nio?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Henri Becquerel descobriu que os compostos de ur\u00e2nio emitiam espontaneamente radia\u00e7\u00e3o penetrante. Ele dividiu o Pr\u00eamio Nobel de F\u00edsica de 1903 com Marie e Pierre Curie.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3802-720f-9078-14c7957f600f","description":"Henri Becquerel","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7228-a2ca-3a112780f0e2","description":"Marie Curie","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-754b-89ea-3187b211137d","description":"Pierre Curie","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7aec-86fe-eee10ad1d0fd","description":"Ernest Rutherford","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7723-ae80-a25b8c054c0e","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O \u00e1cido asc\u00f3rbico \u00e9 comumente conhecido como qual vitamina?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A vitamina C \u00e9 necess\u00e1ria para a produ\u00e7\u00e3o de col\u00e1geno, e os seres humanos precisam obt\u00ea-la dos alimentos, pois n\u00e3o conseguem produzi-la por conta pr\u00f3pria.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3802-75ea-a10c-d8076a5a3bd5","description":"Vitamina C","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7acb-92d9-b55f2003c7a4","description":"Vitamina D","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7ee2-ac94-2ada9d4ddebc","description":"Vitamina A","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-790d-9c51-294ec81bdde3","description":"Vitamina B","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-79f9-8ae5-3f49656cb8fa","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 o s\u00edmbolo qu\u00edmico do cobre?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Cu vem de \u201ccuprum\u201d, o nome latino para cobre.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7e1d-9466-1e5a19dc2259","description":"Cu","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7665-8ee7-632e4daea2ce","description":"Co","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-790c-a3bb-74285a9a520b","description":"C","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7783-ba6a-7ee3a7b8a6c0","description":"K","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7f0b-b1c0-d990dee9ea5e","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Em quantos graus a Terra gira a cada hora?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Uma volta completa equivale a 360 graus; dividindo esse valor por 24 horas, obt\u00e9m-se 15 graus por hora.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7caa-8138-8a2dacc97e85","description":"15","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7115-a150-ef6a161a410e","description":"10","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7d46-9028-fd9c7797af25","description":"24","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-7964-83b9-1ede94296092","description":"30","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3802-79b4-ba5d-980b12fad559","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Para que serve o tricloro-metano, um composto qu\u00edmico frequentemente utilizado?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"O triclorometano, mais conhecido como