k\u201d \u00e9 um grupo de raposas; \u201cschool\u201d geralmente se refere a peixes, \u201cyoke\u201d a bois e \u201cstud\u201d a cavalos reprodutores.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3803-70b1-ab9e-0cdd7b932174","description":"Um \u201cskulk\u201d","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3803-726a-8cc0-7a1c485d11f6","description":"Um \u201cschool\u201d","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3803-7433-b035-dea2c87fa407","description":"Um \u201cyoke\u201d","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3803-7ed3-9d20-7044e957c61a","description":"Um stud","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3803-7acf-b7bc-88db73885e84","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que estuda a coleopterologia?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Os besouros pertencem \u00e0 ordem dos insetos Coleoptera; suas asas dianteiras endurecidas, chamadas \u00e9litros, protegem as asas traseiras.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3803-7227-a42e-f7d8714e5a79","description":"Besouros","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3803-72c1-95fe-642f13295ba8","description":"O Sud\u00e1rio de Turim","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3803-7e1c-8cef-18c6c83ca616","description":"Anjos","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3803-7e26-b247-564e0742fd63","description":"A atmosfera superior","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3803-7175-8afe-48da59bb066a","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual elemento qu\u00edmico tem o s\u00edmbolo Pa?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"O nome \u201cprotact\u00ednio\u201d significa \u201cantes do act\u00ednio\u201d, refletindo o fato de que alguns de seus is\u00f3topos se decomp\u00f5em em act\u00ednio.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3803-78ca-9f77-21a993982e93","description":"Protact\u00ednio","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3803-7aaf-9ae7-2143d5937f67","description":"Pot\u00e1ssio","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3803-7dc0-8ee8-fc5fe60fb920","description":"Chumbo","correct_an